This package exists to reproduce that project's template expression semantics, so it
is derived from it more directly than XLibur.Report is: the expression language it
implements — C# expressions inside {{ }}, the item/index/items row bindings, the
@-prefixed globals, and the value formatting used when interpolating into text — is
ClosedXML.Report's design, reimplemented against XLibur.Report's engine seam.

